{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Ask for another change" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"继续提出修改"}}}},
    "Conversation" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"创作对话"}}}},
    "Review conversation" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看对话"}}}},
    "Back to preview" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"返回预览"}}}},
    "Create, play, then ask for another change. Each message creates a new version of this work." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先生成、再试玩，随时提出下一轮修改。每次发送都会生成这个作品的新版本。"}}}},
    "Existing game and embedded media are inherited. Add materials below only when you need something new." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已继承现有玩法和作品内的素材。需要新素材时再在下方添加。"}}}},
    "What should stay the same?" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"哪些内容保持不变？"}}}},
    "For example: keep the controls, scoring and cat image" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"例如：保留操作方式、计分和猫咪图片"}}}},
    "These instructions stay with the next rounds until you change them." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这些要求会沿用到后续修改，直到你调整它们。"}}}},
    "%lld/8 · Added here" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%lld/8 · 本次添加"}}}},
    "Choose how each file should appear. After generation, play the event you described to check the result." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"为每份素材指定用途。生成后，实际触发你描述的事件来检查效果。"}}}},
    "Removing a file here stops attaching it again. To remove media already in the game, ask for that change in your message." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在此移除只是不再附加这份素材。若要删除游戏中已有的素材，请在修改消息中明确提出。"}}}},
    "Use as" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"素材用途"}}}},
    "Choose from my idea" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"根据创意选择"}}}},
    "Character or object" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"角色或物体"}}}},
    "Background" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"背景"}}}},
    "Reaction or reward" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"事件反馈或奖励"}}}},
    "Visual reference only" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅作视觉参考"}}}},
    "Background music" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"背景音乐"}}}},
    "Sound effect" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"音效"}}}},
    "Video moment" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"视频片段"}}}},
    "Where or when? For example: show this cat after clearing a line" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"位置或时机？例如：消行后在棋盘旁显示这只猫"}}}},
    "Material placement and trigger" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"素材位置与触发时机"}}}},
    "Use for visual direction, not as an in-game image. Image understanding depends on the connected model; describe the details that matter." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅参考视觉风格，不把原图放进游戏。图片理解能力取决于接入的模型，请写出你在意的细节。"}}}},
    "Describe the trigger, position and duration. Keep the board and controls clear." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"说明触发事件、出现位置和持续时间，避免遮挡棋盘与操作按钮。"}}}},
    "Your requests and generation results stay with this work. Continue editing from the current preview; previous versions remain in Profile." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的请求和生成结果会保留在这个作品中。从当前预览继续修改，历史版本可在个人主页查看。"}}}},
    "Loading conversation…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在加载对话…"}}}},
    "Some messages could not be loaded. Your work is still saved." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"部分消息未能加载，作品仍已保存。"}}}},
    "Showing the latest 20 requests." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"显示最近 20 轮请求。"}}}},
    "Your first request will appear here after you generate." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"生成后，第一条请求会显示在这里。"}}}},
    "You" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你"}}}},
    "Keep: %@" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保持不变：%@"}}}},
    "Creating this version…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在生成这一版…"}}}},
    "Preview ready · checks passed" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"预览已就绪 · 检查通过"}}}},
    "Private preview · changes needed" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"私有预览 · 仍需修改"}}}},
    "Cancelled · nothing published" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已取消 · 未发布"}}}},
    "This request needs another try · nothing published" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本轮需要重试 · 未发布"}}}},
    "Material direction" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"素材融合要求"}}}},
    "Technical acceptance details" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"技术验收详情"}}}},
    "Check materials in your preview" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"试玩检查素材效果"}}}},
    "These are your requested uses, not a visual verification result. Play each trigger, then ask for changes if a material is missing or gets in the way." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这里列出的是你要求的用途，并非视觉验收结论。请实际触发每个事件，素材缺失或遮挡时可继续提出修改。"}}}},
    "Preparing your materials" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在准备素材"}}}},
    "New creation" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "新建作品"}}}},
    "Your creation is ready to review" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "作品已生成，点击查看"}}}},
    "Generation needs changes" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "生成结果需要修改"}}}},
    "Materials need attention" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "素材需要处理"}}}},
    "A selected material could not be read. Remove it or upload it again, then generate. Your idea is still here; retrying unchanged will not resolve this issue." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "无法读取所选素材。请移除或重新上传后再生成。创意已保留，直接重试无法解决此问题。"}}}},
    "Material uploads are unavailable. You can create with text while storage is being configured." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "素材上传暂不可用，存储配置完成前可以使用文字创作。"}}}},
    "Elapsed: %lld seconds" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已用时：%lld 秒"}}}},
    "Your app was not created" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "尚未生成你的应用"}}}},
    "Your game is saved · changes needed" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "游戏已保存 · 需要修改"}}}},
    "Recovery screen only · not your requested app" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "仅为恢复页面，尚未完成你的应用"}}}},
    "Play privately, then fix the failed checks" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "先私下试玩，再修复未通过的检查"}}}},
    "Revise idea and start again" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "修改创意后重新生成"}}}},
    "The transfer could not finish. Keep Pulse open, check your connection, and retry. Your selected file is still available." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "上传未完成。请保持 Pulse 打开，检查网络后重试，所选文件已保留。"}}}},
    "Refine this version" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "继续修改当前版本" } } } },
    "Describe the changes. Your current game and its materials will be the starting point." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "描述你想修改的内容。AI 会在当前游戏及素材的基础上继续创作。" } } } },
    "What should change?" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "想修改什么？" } } } },
    "For example: make the pace slower and the colors warmer" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "例如：降低游戏速度，让配色更温暖" } } } },
    "Apply changes" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "应用修改" } } } },
    "Keep editing" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "继续修改" } } } },
    "Your app preview" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "应用预览" } } } },
    "Ready to share" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "可以发布了" } } } },
    "Try this preview and keep refining" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "先试玩，再继续完善" } } } },
    "Title and description" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "标题与玩法说明" } } } },
