    "Selected media will be included in the published app and available to permitted Remixes." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "所选素材将包含在发布的应用中，并可供获准的 Remix 使用。" } } } },
